{"url":"/education","title":"Education Framework — Annabel Ruddle","blocks":[{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/e6b0fd48-5d44-4df3-9b1a-17414677b81c/Education+framework-cover.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H2","text":"Building a UX framework for user education for Bloomberg"},{"type":"p","text":"Bloomberg Professional App (Apple) (Google Play)"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Results"},{"type":"p","text":"Clear documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Systemized use of education patterns across 45 teams"},{"type":"p","text":"Increased total usage of app by 15%"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Team"},{"type":"p","text":"Annabel - Senior Interaction Designer (Lead Designer)"},{"type":"p","text":"Product Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Engineers"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Project Duration"},{"type":"p","text":"5 months"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"IOS & Android"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"Figma"},{"type":"p","text":"Google Docs"},{"type":"p","text":"Google Sheets"},{"type":"heading","level":"H1","text":"Problem"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/febc2211-e52c-4cff-a182-f26729b0597a/prob.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Bloomberg Anywhere* users were not using the app to its fullest potential."},{"type":"p","text":"*Bloomberg Anywhere = Bloomberg Terminal + Bloomberg Professional App"},{"type":"heading","level":"H1","text":"Opportunity"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/d290027d-293a-41fc-99f6-2cca4442a859/ios.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"“How-To” a centralized self-discovery resource"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/7f68d297-d4b9-4139-a712-b4bf17edb395/Audit.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Current State"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/f3ef4ffe-feb7-4bf9-a99d-a1070efaf375/Personas+to+system.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/943060af-b013-4d92-98cb-7c2e8d88eeac/image+15.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/8d0be728-3f63-4497-bd33-e0c51e9cf8f4/image+16.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/5256a92f-398b-4650-9a4d-792b7a9db449/image+17.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Ideate & Narrow"},{"type":"p","text":"Explored a number of approaches and ideas, using the existing tour component and narrowed down to two…"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Approach 1"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Collection First List Approach"},{"type":"li","text":"Content is organized into Collections"},{"type":"li","text":"“Apple Tips”"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/6a0dfd48-6d09-4b6d-875d-3c8f068a07ab/Tips-UXR-Collection.gif"},{"type":"heading","level":"H4","text":"Approach 2"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"Content First Feed Approach"},{"type":"li","text":"No hierarchy, no layers to go through, just straight into the content"},{"type":"li","text":"“Tiktok, IG”"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/19ea241d-4a51-4630-be86-eab4c2553321/Tips-FeedUXR.gif"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/61a3b4c4-5975-44a7-bbe3-18dccfdf6897/usertest.png"},{"type":"heading","level":"H3","text":"User Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Tested 2 approaches/variants (A&B) of this resource with 11 clients, in-person and remote to understand which was more valuable, current client modes and methods of learning (answering the how, when, & where), and to evaluate the effectiveness of our hypothesis to increase overall engagement and feature adoption."},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/0e581690-63d8-49e9-a0ab-a1603dae2f10/Screenshot+2024-08-28+at+8.29.58%E2%80%AFAM.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/e21b9a92-53e9-4b12-92ef-6de15b9caa84/data.png"},{"type":"img","src":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/618840c3efab506702a40c99/e8b4b04b-73a4-44b9-806a-af1c65dd8efa/Screenshot+2024-08-28+at+8.27.34%E2%80%AFAM.png"}]}
